{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "canon_version": "c1",
  "description": "SSOT of the Modo Nube cloud schema capability-set (I5). Per entity, the DOMAIN columns the iOS client understands, each declaring EXACTLY ONE of {\"safe\":true (independent field-level unit) | \"group_key\":<money|split|budget> (atomic coherence group, d.4bis)}. No silent safe-by-omission default: an unclassified column FAILS the parity build. Server-authored + identity columns are NOT listed (see server_only_columns / identity_columns). Append-only: a column never leaves nor changes its type/scale/group.",
  "server_only_columns": [
    "user_id",
    "server_seq",
    "hlc",
    "field_hlcs",
    "deleted",
    "deleted_hlc",
    "schema_version",
    "updated_at"
  ],
  "identity_columns": [
    "sync_id"
  ],
  "coherence_groups": {
    "money": {
      "entity": "tx_items",
      "columns": [
        "amount",
        "amount_in_preferred_currency",
        "exchange_rate",
        "preferred_currency_code",
        "is_exchange_rate_provisional"
      ]
    },
    "split": {
      "entity": "scheduled_payments",
      "columns": [
        "amount",
        "split_type",
        "split_total_amount",
        "split_participant_ids_raw",
        "split_values_raw"
      ]
    },
    "budget": {
      "entity": "budgets",
      "columns": [
        "limit_amount",
        "currency_code",
        "natures",
        "subcategory_ids",
        "account_ids",
        "tag_refs"
      ]
    },
    "tx_split": {
      "entity": "tx_items",
      "columns": [
        "split_divisor",
        "split_my_value",
        "split_total_amount",
        "split_type"
      ],
      "rationale": "Decision owner 2026-07-07 (review adversarial I5): split_type discrimina la interpretacion de split_my_value/split_divisor (percentage/shares/exact) — mismo acople que el grupo split de scheduled_payments. Residual documentado: amount (grupo money) es derivado de estos 4; un merge cross-group puede divergir amount de sus insumos — cosmetico (las sumatorias consumen amount; estos campos son la memoria del editor)."
    }
  },
